            <h2 class="h3 fw-bold mt-5">34. Best Practices</h2>

            <ul>
                <li>Use labels for meaningful form controls.</li>
                <li>Match <code>for</code> and <code>id</code> correctly.</li>
                <li>Use unique <code>id</code> values.</li>
                <li>Keep labels descriptive.</li>
                <li>Use fieldsets for related groups when appropriate.</li>
                <li>Do not depend only on placeholder text.</li>
                <li>Keep form labels consistent across the application.</li>
            </ul>

